annotorious.js is the UMD build (dist/annotorious.js), which defines the global
`Annotorious` from a plain <script> tag: no npm, no bundler, no build step.
Do not replace it with dist/annotorious.es.js, and do not reach for
@annotorious/react — that one ships ESM chunks with unresolved bare `react`
imports and cannot be loaded without a bundler.

To update, take dist/annotorious.js and dist/annotorious.css from the published
tarball and refresh this file:

    npm pack @annotorious/annotorious@<version>

The trailing `//# sourceMappingURL=annotorious.js.map` comment is stripped: the
map is not vendored, and leaving the comment in makes every browser with
devtools open request a file that is not there.
